WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Locate. Assign one location to a resolution-7 H3 cell.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Outline. Convert the cell boundary to longitude-first GeoJSON.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Compare. Finer resolution covers a smaller area; geometry is independent of population.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Join later. Use population attributes as a separate source before calculating exposure or density.
